---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<section class="border-b-2 border-dark bg-gray-50 px-4 py-20 md:px-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <h2 class="mb-16 text-center text-3xl font-extrabold md:text-4xl">Dari Manual ke Lebih Rapi</h2>
    <div class="relative flex flex-col items-stretch gap-8 md:flex-row">
      <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 z-10 hidden h-12 w-12 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-dark bg-white text-dark shadow-neo-sm md:flex">
        <Icon name="ArrowRight" class="h-6 w-6" />
      </div>
      <div class="relative flex-1 rounded-2xl border-2 border-dark bg-white p-8 shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_#ef4444] transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="absolute -top-5 left-8 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border-2 border-dark bg-red-100 px-4 py-1 font-bold text-red-700 shadow-neo-sm"><Icon name="XCircle" class="h-4 w-4" /> Sebelum</div>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-5">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 font-medium text-gray-700"><Icon name="FileSpreadsheet" class="h-6 w-6 shrink-0 text-red-500" /> Data tersebar di Excel</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 font-medium text-gray-700"><Icon name="MessageSquare" class="h-6 w-6 shrink-0 text-red-500" /> Status pekerjaan tanya lewat chat</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 font-medium text-gray-700"><Icon name="ClipboardList" class="h-6 w-6 shrink-0 text-red-500" /> Rekap laporan manual</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 font-medium text-gray-700"><Icon name="SearchX" class="h-6 w-6 shrink-0 text-red-500" /> Dokumen sulit dicari</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="relative flex-1 rounded-2xl border-2 border-dark bg-brand-blue p-8 text-white shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_#111827] transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="absolute -top-5 left-8 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-blue-400/20 px-4 py-1 font-bold text-white shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(255,255,255,0.3)] backdrop-blur-sm"><Icon name="CheckCircle2" class="h-4 w-4" /> Sesudah</div>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-5">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 font-medium text-blue-50"><Icon name="Database" class="h-6 w-6 shrink-0 text-brand-yellow" /> Data tersimpan di sistem</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 font-medium text-blue-50"><Icon name="LayoutDashboard" class="h-6 w-6 shrink-0 text-brand-yellow" /> Status terlihat di dashboard</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 font-medium text-blue-50"><Icon name="Filter" class="h-6 w-6 shrink-0 text-brand-yellow" /> Laporan bisa difilter/export</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 font-medium text-blue-50"><Icon name="FolderCheck" class="h-6 w-6 shrink-0 text-brand-yellow" /> Dokumen tersimpan per data</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-2xl text-center">
      <p class="rounded-xl border-2 border-dark bg-yellow-50 p-4 text-lg font-medium text-gray-700 shadow-neo-sm">
        <Icon name="Lightbulb" class="mr-1 inline-block h-5 w-5 -mt-1 text-brand-yellow" />
        Banyak sistem tidak harus besar. Kadang yang dibutuhkan hanya tempat kerja yang lebih rapi, jelas, dan mudah dicek.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
